---
layout: base.njk
title: About Us — 10 Years of Vision Excellence
description: Learn about Naina Optics, Bangalore's trusted optical shop since 2014. Meet proprietor Satya P Bharati and discover our story, mission, and the premium brands we carry.
bodyClass: page-about
---

<div class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About Naina Optics</h1>
    <p>A decade of clarity, care, and quality eyewear in the heart of Bangalore</p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- OUR STORY -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story-grid fade-in">
      <div class="story-text">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p>
          In 2014, Satya P Bharati opened Naina Optics on Residency Road with a single conviction: Bangaloreans deserved an optical store that combined genuine technical expertise with access to the world's finest eyewear brands. The name <em>Naina</em> — meaning "eyes" in Hindi — captured the vision perfectly.
        </p>
        <p>
          What began as a neighbourhood optical store has grown into one of Bangalore's most trusted destinations for premium eyewear. Over a decade, we have served thousands of customers — from the first-time spectacle wearer navigating a new prescription to the dedicated Ray-Ban collector seeking the latest limited edition.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, operating as <strong>PIIXELL by Naina Optics</strong>, we bring a modern identity to the same trusted service and expertise. Our core values have never changed: honest advice, genuine products, expert fitting, and a personal relationship with every customer that walks through our door.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="story-image">
        <!-- TODO: Add store photo: <img src="/assets/images/about/store-front.jpg" alt="PIIXELL by Naina Optics store on Residency Road, Bangalore" style="border-radius:var(--radius-lg); box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);"> -->
        <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary)); border-radius:var(--radius-lg); aspect-ratio:4/3; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:5rem;">🏪</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS -->
<section class="stats-bar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="stat-value">10+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Years in Service</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="stat-value">5000+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Happy Customers</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="stat-value">20+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Premium Brands</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="stat-value">3</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Product Categories</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MISSION & VISION -->
<section class="section" style="background:var(--surface);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Our Mission &amp; Vision</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid; gap:1.5rem; max-width:860px; margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="feature-card" style="text-align:left;">
        <h3>🎯 Our Mission</h3>
        <p>To provide every customer in Bangalore with expertly fitted, genuinely protective eyewear — backed by honest advice, transparent pricing, and personalised service that turns a functional purchase into a confident choice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card" style="text-align:left;">
        <h3>🔭 Our Vision</h3>
        <p>To be Bangalore's most trusted optical destination — the store where customers come not just to buy glasses, but to build a long-term relationship with professionals who genuinely understand their vision needs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TEAM -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Meet Our Team</h2>
      <p>Experienced optical professionals dedicated to your vision health</p>
    </div>
    <div class="team-grid">
      <div class="team-card">
        <!-- TODO: <img src="/assets/images/team/satya-bharati.jpg" alt="Satya P Bharati, Proprietor of Naina Optics"> -->
        <div class="team-avatar">SB</div>
        <div class="team-name">Satya P Bharati</div>
        <div class="team-role">Proprietor &amp; Business Head</div>
        <p class="team-bio">With over 10 years in the optical industry, Satya brings deep product knowledge and a genuine passion for helping customers find their perfect eyewear. His expertise spans prescription lenses, sports eyewear, and luxury frames.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-avatar">👓</div>
        <div class="team-name">Our Optical Team</div>
        <div class="team-role">Certified Optical Advisors</div>
        <p class="team-bio">Our in-store team is trained in frame fitting, lens selection, and optical adjustment. They stay updated with the latest developments from Ray-Ban, Oakley, Crizal, and other leading brands we carry.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->
<section class="section" style="background:var(--surface);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Why Customers Choose Us</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">✅</span>
        <h3>Authorised Retailer</h3>
        <p>Every product we sell is 100% genuine — sourced directly from authorised distributors. All frames come with manufacturer warranty.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">🔍</span>
        <h3>Expert Fitting</h3>
        <p>A lens that's optically perfect but physically misaligned causes eye strain. Our team ensures every pair is correctly adjusted to your face.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">🤝</span>
        <h3>After-Sales Service</h3>
        <p>Frame adjustments, nose pad replacements, tightening — free for life on frames purchased with us. We're your long-term optical partner.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feature-icon">💬</span>
        <h3>Personal Advice</h3>
        <p>No upselling, no pressure. We listen to your needs and budget, and recommend what genuinely suits you — nothing more, nothing less.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BRANDS -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Brands We Carry</h2>
      <p>Authorised retailer for Bangalore's most sought-after eyewear brands</p>
    </div>
    <div class="brands-grid">
      {% for brand in site.brands %}
      <span class="brand-chip">{{ brand }}</span>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Come Visit Us on Residency Road</h2>
    <p>{{ site.hoursShort }} — {{ site.fullAddress }}</p>
    <div class="cta-banner__actions">
      <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}" class="btn btn--outline-white" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp Us</a>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--outline-white">Get Directions</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
